ub.io` somewhere and GitHub said: create a repo named `Z3-FE.github.io` instead. So step 1 is: create repo `Z3-FE/z3-fe.github.io` in the org (via web UI since gh isn't installed, or install gh).\n\nI can't create org repos myself (no gh, no token). So the user must do that one manual step, OR I install gh via brew and they run `gh auth login` (interactive, can't do for them).\n\nGiven all this, the best response structure:\n\n1. 解释报错：GitHub 不允许把 `*.github.io` 当自定义域名填，正确做法是建一个名为 `z3-fe.github.io` 的仓库（大小写无所谓，GitHub 会按小写处理——actually repo name Z3-FE.github.io, Pages serves at z3-fe.github.io regardless of case）\n2. 说明前提：Pages 只能托管静态文件；这个项目前端是 Next.js(有服务端 API 代理 + 动态路由)，后端 FastAPI 无法部署到 Pages。需要静态导出 + 后端另行部署（或演示模式）。\n3. 给出具体行动方案：\n   - 第一步（你来做）：在 Z3-FE 组织下建仓库 `z3-fe.github.io`（网页上 create repo）\n   - 第二步（我来做）：改造前端支持 `output: 'export'`（处理动态路由、API 路由排除、图片 unoptimized），构建出 out/\n   - 第三步（我来做）：把构建产物推到新仓库，开启 Pages（Settings → Pages → deploy from branch main）\n4. 问用户确认：是否要我把前端改成静态导出并部署？（以及后端数据接口怎么办——部署到哪里）\n\nShould I ask via AskUserQuestion? There are genuine decision points:\n- 后端没着落，纯静态部署只能展示 UI 壳（数据请求会失败）——接受吗？\n- 部署哪个项目：完整项目 09_enterprise_data_intelligence_platform 的前端？（当前 workspace 的 ai_data_analysis 是残缺副本）\n\nActually, since the user twice said \"当前项目我想部署\", and 当前 workspace is ai_data_analysis... but that's clearly a fragment (can't deploy 3 files). The sensible target is the full project's frontend. I discovered that last turn. I'll state this clearly and proceed with the full frontend.\n\nRather than asking many questions, I think the pragmatic move: do the verification work now (try static export build locally to see if it works and what breaks), so my plan is grounded in facts, then present the user with: (a) what to create (repo), (b) verified build result, (c) ask about backend handling.\n\nActually, let me not modify their next.config.ts yet without asking... Hmm, but trying a build requires config changes. I could create the export config as a separate step and